#
# Well-formed: a continuous map that declares its continuity (not assumed).
# Conforms to math:ContinuousMapShape. Bound by ex:ecContinuousMapDeclared.
@prefix math: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/math/> .
@prefix ex:   <http://example.org/math/> .

ex:inclusion a math:ContinuousMap ;
    math:isContinuous true ;
    math:preservesStructure math:continuityLaw .
